●Find student who scored more than 400
●Find student belonging to course CS and marks greater than 400
●Retrieve the students who are either in course CS or have scored more than 400
●Write a query to sort the documents in the descending order of marks
●Select all students of CS and sort them in descending order of rollno and display only course and rollno

